					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圓"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720203,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，快看，這裡有好大一隻大團雀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720204,
					"content": "我可不是團雀，我的名字是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圓"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720205,
					"content": "#哎呀…這麼一說，我的名字…連我自己都記不清啦，{F#妳}{M#你}們就稱呼我阿圓好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圓"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720206,
					"content": "阿圓，我們以前好像從來沒在蒙德看到過妳呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720207,
					"content": "在蒙德能見到或許才是奇特之事，實不相瞞，我本來就是自璃月而來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圓"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720208,
					"content": "唔，是這樣呀…可是，阿圓從璃月來到蒙德的貓尾酒館裡是為了什麼呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720209,
						706720212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
